position = Vector2(418, 455)
script = ExtResource("7_36an1")
prompt_text = "[E] Read Exam Paper"
modal_title = "MID-TERM EXAM: MATHEMATICS & LOGIC"
modal_content = "STUDENT: Arun Sharma | ROLL NO: 24 | TIME: 90 MINS
---------------------------------------------------------
Q1. If mental pressure increases by 20% every minute,
    calculate the time remaining until complete freeze.
    [Arun's scribbled answer in margin:
     'Take a deep breath and Bounce Back!']

Q2. Solve for x:  x + Anxiety = Progress
    [Teacher's note in red ink:
     'x = Resilience. You've got this, Arun!']

Q3. Multiple Choice:
    When feeling overwhelmed, you should:
    (A) Panic and freeze
    (B) Give up completely
    (C) Breathe, focus, and step forward [X]"

